{"id":"n24538-1-8","stage":3,"title":"국내선 · 国内线","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24538-1-8-1","ko":"이곳에서 부산으로 가는 비행기가 있습니까?","zh":"这里有飞往釜山的飞机吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳에서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이곳에서","audio":"/audio/16cc1fd5036481af180f.mp3"}},{"text":"부산으로","meaning":"釜山","explanation":"부산：釜山；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"부산으로","audio":"/audio/79c36109d8bebedf8b32.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부산으로","audio":"/audio/79c36109d8bebedf8b32.mp3"}},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"비행기가","meaning":"飞机","explanation":"비행기：飞机；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비행기","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15679","senseId":"1","lemma":"비행기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비행기가","audio":"/audio/157e5121fffc8749cd69.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니까?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있습니까","audio":"/audio/82a1efff276ac41f1dca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp